     1,
     "<div>Good question. these are calculated over the full window (MM or WW, depending on which report you look at), and represent the percentile in the acceleration distribution of the respectively 60 and 30 most active minutes in the day.<br></div><div><br></div><div>As part 2 early heavily focuses on describing the acceleration distribution, I kept it simple for part 5.</div><div><br></div><div>Vincent</div><div><br></div><div>‐‐‐‐‐‐‐ Original Message ‐‐‐‐‐‐‐<br></div>"
    ],
